# Code Style & Module Layout

## Prettier (`.prettierrc`)

- `printWidth: 120`, `semi: true`, `singleQuote: true`, `bracketSameLine: true`, `arrowParens: always`
- Run Prettier before committing; do not fight the formatter.

## Imports

```typescript
// ✅ Workspace packages
import { prisma } from '@repo/database';
import { ProblemDetails } from '@repo/contracts';

// ✅ Intra-package alias
import { apiClient } from '~/lib/api-client';

// ❌ Deep-import another package's internals
import { something } from '@repo/database/prisma/foo';
```

Export public APIs through each package's `src/index.ts`.

## Service module layout

```
services/content/src/modules/blog/
  blog.controller.ts   # HTTP → service
  blog.service.ts      # business rules
  blog.repository.ts   # Prisma only
  blog.schema.ts       # zod (from @repo/contracts)
```

Keep modules small and explicit — no hidden magic config.

## Observability

- Structured **JSON logs** with correlation ID propagated from gateway (`X-Correlation-Id`).
- Every service exposes `GET /health`.

## Comments

Prefer self-explanatory code. Comment only non-obvious business rules or security constraints.
